Bumped when the page GEOMETRY in tools/make_bookvault_files.py changes:
the placement of the master on the media, the bleed, the fit scale, the
safety shift, or how the margin fill is drawn.

touch this file whenever one of those changes, so tools/build_all_bookvault.py
knows which packs on disk were built with the old placement. A check-only edit
does NOT need it: re-run the checks against the files already built with

    .venv/bin/python tools/recheck_bookvault_pack.py <slug> ...
